            <ArticleTitle>[State of protease inhibitor system in patients with occupational bronchial asthma caused by nonferrous metal aerosols].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>22-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The article represents results of studies concerning biochemical features of inflammation in various types of bronchial asthma caused by nonferrous metal aerosols. Also parameters of &quot;proteolysis--antiproteolysis&quot; system were studied on molecular genetic and biochemical levels, with determining serine proteinase, level of protease alpha-1 inhibitor and its hyposecretory deficit variants, levels of individual proteins.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
